    "BattleFrontier_ScottsHouse_Text_HaveThisAsMementoOfOurPathsCrossing": ["Our paths crossed long before\\p", "this place mattered to you.\\p", "Take what the road taught you\\p", "into every challenge here.\\p", "And take this, too.$"],
